{"version": "https://jsonfeed.org/version/1", "title": "MiSTer FPGA Documentation (fork with editorial improvements)", "home_page_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/", "feed_url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/feed_json_updated.json", "description": "MiSTer FPGA is an open source project that aims to recreate various classic computers, game consoles, and arcade machines, using modern hardware.", "icon": "assets/mister_kun_bw.svg", "authors": [{"name": "Kevin Coleman"}], "language": "en", "items": [{"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/what/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/what/", "title": "What Is a Core", "content_html": "<h1>What Is a Core</h1>\n<p>In MiSTer terminology, a core is an FPGA design that provides a particular system or function. Most cores implement a console, computer, or...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/what.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:42:14+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/what/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/what/", "title": "\u30b3\u30a2\u3068\u306f", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306e\u7528\u8a9e\u3067\u30b3\u30a2\u3068\u306f\u3001\u7279\u5b9a\u306e\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u3084\u6a5f\u80fd\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3059\u308b FPGA \u8a2d\u8a08\u306e\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3059\u3002\u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306e\u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u30b3\u30f3\u30bd\u30fc\u30eb\u30fb\u30b3\u30f3\u30d4\u30e5\u30fc\u30bf\u30fc\u30fb\u30a2\u30fc\u30b1\u30fc\u30c9\u30b7\u30b9\u30c6\u30e0\u3092\u5b9f\u88c5\u3057\u307e\u3059\u304c\u3001Menu \u30b3\u30a2\u306f\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u30fc\u30a4\u30f3\u30bf\u30fc\u30d5\u30a7\u30a4\u30b9\u3092\u63d0\u4f9b\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002\u30c7\u30d5\u30a9\u30eb\u30c8\u3067\u306f\u8d77\u52d5\u6642\u306b MiSTer \u304c Menu \u30b3\u30a2\u3092\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307f\u307e\u3059\u3002<code>_Console</code>...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/what.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:42:14+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/conf_str/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/conf_str/", "title": "Core Configuration String", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer provides an on-screen display (OSD) that can be toggled on and off by pressing F12 on your keyboard (or OSD button). For each core that is loaded, thi...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/conf_str.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:16:37+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/network/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/network/", "title": "Advanced Networking", "content_html": "<p>The MiSTer has several advanced networking features.</p>\n<h2>Network access</h2>\n<p>The MiSTer board can be accessed through the on-board Ethernet port. The system has *...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/network.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:06:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/faq/", "title": "FAQ", "content_html": "<p>Answers to frequently asked questions about MiSTer. If something is missing, feel free to contribute by editing this page on GitHub with the Edit (pen) icon ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:06:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/hotkey/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/hotkey/", "title": "Hotkeys", "content_html": "<p>This page lists the MiSTer hotkeys. Hotkeys save time, and some actions can only be done with a keyboard or gamepad hotkey. Some hotkeys work only in the Mai...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/hotkey.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:06:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/input/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/input/", "title": "Controllers", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer supports a wide variety of input devices. It also offers options for configuring them and several quality-of-life features that work in most (sometime...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/input.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:06:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/troubleshooting/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/troubleshooting/", "title": "Troubleshooting", "content_html": "<h2>The MiSTer FPGA's correct DIP switch configuration on the DE10-Nano</h2>\n<p>If your keyboard or other low-level hardware doesn't work, one or more of the DIP swi...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/troubleshooting.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:06:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/wifi/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/basics/wifi/", "title": "WiFi", "content_html": "<p>WiFi is optional and simple to set up on the MiSTer. You'll need a compatible dongle, the <code>wifi.sh</code> script (provided with the Mr. Fusion image), and a keyboa...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/wifi.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:06:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/saturn/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/saturn/", "title": "Saturn", "content_html": "<p>The Sega Saturn MiSTer core, originally developed by <a href=\"https://www.patreon.com/srg320/\">srg320 (Sergey Dvodnenko)</a>{target=_blank}, reproduces the original har...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/saturn.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:06:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/network/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/advanced/network/", "title": "\u9ad8\u5ea6\u306a\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u306f\u9ad8\u5ea6\u306a\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u6a5f\u80fd\u304c\u3044\u304f\u3064\u304b\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u30cd\u30c3\u30c8\u30ef\u30fc\u30af\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9 { #network-access }</h2>\n<p>MiSTer \u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u306f\u30aa\u30f3\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9 Ethernet \u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u7d4c\u7531\u3067\u30a2\u30af\u30bb\u30b9\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002<strong>FTP</strong>\u3001<strong>SSH</strong>\u3001<strong>SFTP</strong> \u30b5\u30fc\u30d3\u30b9\u304c\u52d5\u3044\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p>\u30e6\u30fc\u30b6\u30fc\u540d: **r...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/network.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:06:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/input/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/input/", "title": "\u30b3\u30f3\u30c8\u30ed\u30fc\u30e9\u30fc", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306f\u591a\u7a2e\u591a\u69d8\u306a\u5165\u529b\u6a5f\u5668\u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3001\u8a2d\u5b9a\u30aa\u30d7\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3\u3084\u3001\u307b\u3068\u3093\u3069\u306e\uff08\u5834\u5408\u306b\u3088\u3063\u3066\u306f\u3059\u3079\u3066\u306e\uff09\u30b3\u30a2\u3067\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\u4fbf\u5229\u6a5f\u80fd\u3082\u5099\u3048\u3066\u3044\u307e\u3059\u3002\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3067\u306f\u30b9\u30d4\u30ca\u30fc\u30fb\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u30d1\u30c3\u30c9\u30fb\u30b8\u30e7\u30a4\u30b9\u30c6\u30a3\u30c3\u30af\u30fb\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306a\u3069\u306e\u6a5f\u5668\u306e\u7279\u6b8a\u306a\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3092\u8aac\u660e\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u3069\u3093\u306a\u6a5f\u5668\u304c\u4f7f\u3048\u308b\uff1f</h2>\n<p>\u57fa\u672c\u7684\u306b\u3001\u901a\u5e38\u306e USB HID \u4e92\u63db\u5165\u529b\u6a5f...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/input.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:06:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/troubleshooting/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/troubleshooting/", "title": "\u30c8\u30e9\u30d6\u30eb\u30b7\u30e5\u30fc\u30c6\u30a3\u30f3\u30b0", "content_html": "<h2>DE10-Nano \u4e0a\u306e MiSTer FPGA \u306e\u6b63\u3057\u3044 DIP \u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u8a2d\u5b9a</h2>\n<p>\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306a\u3069\u306e\u4f4e\u30ec\u30d9\u30eb\u30cf\u30fc\u30c9\u30a6\u30a7\u30a2\u304c\u52d5\u304b\u306a\u3044\u5834\u5408\u3001DE10-Nano \u306e DIP \u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1\u304c1\u3064\u4ee5\u4e0a\u8aa4\u3063\u3066\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3055\u308c\u3066\u3044\u308b\u53ef\u80fd\u6027\u304c\u3042\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h3>\u4e0a\u6bb5\u306e DIP \u30b9\u30a4\u30c3\u30c1</h3>\n<p>\u56f3\u306e\u3068\u304a\u308a\u306b\u306a\u3063\u3066\u3044\u308b\u304b\u78ba\u8a8d\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\uff1a ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/troubleshooting.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:06:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/wifi/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/wifi/", "title": "Wi-Fi", "content_html": "<p>WiFi \u306f\u4efb\u610f\u3067\u3001MiSTer \u3067\u306f\u7c21\u5358\u306b\u8a2d\u5b9a\u3067\u304d\u307e\u3059\u3002\u5fc5\u8981\u306a\u306e\u306f\u5bfe\u5fdc\u30c9\u30f3\u30b0\u30eb\u3001<code>wifi.sh</code> \u30b9\u30af\u30ea\u30d7\u30c8\uff08Mr. Fusion \u30a4\u30e1\u30fc\u30b8\u306b\u4ed8\u5c5e\uff09\u3001\u305d\u3057\u3066 WiFi \u30d1\u30b9\u30ef\u30fc\u30c9\u3092\u5165\u529b\u3059\u308b\u305f\u3081\u306e\u30ad\u30fc\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u3060\u3051\u3067\u3059\u3002</p>\n<h2>\u63a8\u5968 WiFi \u30a2\u30c0\u30d7\u30bf\u30fc</h2>\n<p>DE10-Nano \u306b\u3082 MiSTer \u62e1\u5f35\u30dc\u30fc\u30c9\u306b\u3082 ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/wifi.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:06:18+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/rtc/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/advanced/rtc/", "title": "RTC Board", "content_html": "<p><img alt=\"MiSTer FPGA RTC Add-on board\" src=\"img/rtc1.jpg\"></p>\n<p>Some cores (ao486, Minimig) use a clock, so MiSTer provides them with the real time. When an Internet connecti...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/advanced/rtc.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T06:01:51+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/gb2p/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/cores/highlights/gb2p/", "title": "Game Boy 2-Player", "content_html": "<h2>Game Boy 2-Player Demonstration</h2>\n<p>This is a demonstration of Game Boy link-cable play: two Game Boy cores run side by side, with the link cable connection ...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/gb2p.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:58:56+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/gb2p/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/cores/highlights/gb2p/", "title": "Game Boy 2\u4eba\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4", "content_html": "<h2>Game Boy 2\u4eba\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u306e\u30c7\u30e2\u30f3\u30b9\u30c8\u30ec\u30fc\u30b7\u30e7\u30f3</h2>\n<p>\u3053\u308c\u306f Game Boy \u306e\u30ea\u30f3\u30af\u30b1\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u5bfe\u6226\u306e\u30c7\u30e2\u3067\u3059\u30022\u3064\u306e Game Boy \u30b3\u30a2\u304c\u4e26\u5217\u306b\u52d5\u4f5c\u3057\u3001\u305d\u306e\u9593\u306e\u30ea\u30f3\u30af\u30b1\u30fc\u30d6\u30eb\u63a5\u7d9a\u3092\u30a8\u30df\u30e5\u30ec\u30fc\u30c8\u3059\u308b\u3053\u3068\u3067\u3001\u30de\u30eb\u30c1\u30d7\u30ec\u30a4\u30b2\u30fc\u30e0\u304c\u53ef\u80fd\u306b\u306a\u308a\u307e\u3059\u3002</p>\n<p><img alt=\"type:video\" src=\"videos/gb2p.mp4\"></p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/cores/highlights/gb2p.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:58:56+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/faq/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/basics/faq/", "title": "\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u8cea\u554f", "content_html": "<p>MiSTer \u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066\u3088\u304f\u3042\u308b\u8cea\u554f\u3078\u306e\u56de\u7b54\u3067\u3059\u3002\u4f55\u304b\u4e0d\u8db3\u3057\u3066\u3044\u308c\u3070\u3001\u53f3\u4e0a\u306e Edit\uff08\u30da\u30f3\uff09\u30a2\u30a4\u30b3\u30f3\u304b\u3089 GitHub \u4e0a\u3067\u3053\u306e\u30da\u30fc\u30b8\u3092\u7de8\u96c6\u3057\u3066\u8ca2\u732e\u3057\u3066\u304f\u3060\u3055\u3044\u3002</p>\n<h2>MiSTer \u306b\u3064\u3044\u3066</h2>\n<h3>MiSTer \u306e\u30bb\u30c3\u30c8\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u306f\u96e3\u3057\u3044\uff1f \u672c\u5f53\u306b\u3044\u3058\u304f\u308a\u56de\u3059\u306e\u304c\u597d\u304d\u306a\u6280\u8853\u8005\u5411\u3051\u306a\u306e\uff1f</h3>\n<p>\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3001\u3044\u3044\u3048\u3002\u3044\u3058...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/basics/faq.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:58:20+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/debugging/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/developer/debugging/", "title": "Debugging (USB Blaster)", "content_html": "<p>While developing a core, it's convenient to upload it through the USB Blaster (JTAG) port directly from Quartus. MiSTer supports USB Blaster and automaticall...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/debugging.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:57:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}, {"id": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/debugging/", "url": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/ja/developer/debugging/", "title": "\u30c7\u30d0\u30c3\u30b0\uff08USB Blaster\uff09", "content_html": "<p>\u30b3\u30a2\u958b\u767a\u4e2d\u306f\u3001Quartus \u304b\u3089 USB Blaster\uff08JTAG\uff09\u30dd\u30fc\u30c8\u7d4c\u7531\u3067\u76f4\u63a5\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30ed\u30fc\u30c9\u3059\u308b\u3068\u4fbf\u5229\u3067\u3059\u3002MiSTer \u306f USB Blaster \u306b\u5bfe\u5fdc\u3057\u3001\u30a2\u30c3\u30d7\u30ed\u30fc\u30c9\u3055\u308c\u305f\u30b3\u30a2\u7528\u306b Linux \u90e8\u5206\u3092\u81ea\u52d5\u7684\u306b\u518d\u8aad\u307f\u8fbc\u307f\u3057\u307e\u3059\u3002Linux \u306f\u518d\u8d77\u52d5\u304c\u5fc5\u8981\u306a\u305f\u3081\uff08\u5b89\u5b9a\u6027\u5411\u4e0a\u306e\u305f\u3081\uff09\u3001\u8d77\u52d5\u6642\u9593\u304c\u9577\u304f\u306a\u308b\u306e\u306b...</p>", "image": "https://hexfokker.github.io/MkDocs_MiSTer/assets/images/social/developer/debugging.ja.png", "date_modified": "2026-10-25T05:57:42+00:00", "authors": [], "tags": null}]}